          "correction_answer": "$P(A) \\times P(B) = \\dfrac{1}{3} \\times \\dfrac{3}{8} = \\dfrac{1}{8} = P(A \\cap B)$. Donc $A$ et $B$ sont indépendants. \\medskip",
          "correction_answer_scope": "question",
