          "correction_answer": "$P(A \\cup B) = P(A) + P(B) - P(A \\cap B) = \\dfrac{1}{3} + \\dfrac{3}{8} - \\dfrac{1}{8} = \\dfrac{8+9-3}{24} = \\dfrac{14}{24} = \\dfrac{7}{12}$. \\medskip",
          "correction_answer_scope": "question",
          "points": "1 pt",
          "question": "Q2",
          "statement": "Calculer $P(A \\cup B)$. \\hfill\\textit{(1 pt --- calculer)}",
          "to_be_written_by_a_teacher": {
